SUMMARY:Laugh & Run with Tommy McClellan-Willard
LOCATION:New York Comedy Club Upper West Side\, 236 W 78th Street\, New Yor
 k
DESCRIPTION:Grab tickets now to support a great cause\, and get ready for a
  night that’ll get your heart rate up in more ways than one! Laugh & Run 
 with Tommy McClellan-Willard starts with a group run at 6:30 PM and is foll
 owed by a full stand-up show at 7:30 PM\, so lace up and work up an appetit
 e for laughs before you take your seat. A portion of ticket proceeds will d
 irectly support Back on My Feet and its mission to combat homelessness thro
 ugh the power of running\, community support\, and access to employment and
  housing resources. Bring your running crew\, grab a few extra tickets for 
 friends\, and join us for an evening of laughs and community.Tommy McClella
 n-Willard started running and doing stand up when he was twelve years old. 
 Since then he’s made multiple appearances on The Late Show with Stephen C
 olbert and his debut stand up album was #1 on Amazon. As an athlete\, Tommy
  placed 2nd at the 2024 USA Winter Triathlon National Championship and qual
 ified on team USA in the elite/professional division for the 2025 Winter Tr
 iathlon World Championship. He has his own show\, The Laugh & Run Podcast\,
  that interviews prominent figures in the running and comedy industry with 
 a focus of bringing people together through laughter and running. He headli
 nes all around the US with his stand up Laugh & Run show. Last but not leas
 t\, he is a certified running coach with the Road Runner's Club of America.
 \nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/laugh-run-with-tomm
 y-mcclellan-willard/
